\fs36 \cf0 Project Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This project analyses NHS England Accident & Emergency (A&E) attendance and waiting-time data for June 2026 using SQL.\
The analysis focuses on Type 1 A&E departments and investigates regional differences in the proportion of attendances exceeding four hours.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

