\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Dataset\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Source:
\f1\b0  NHS England \'97 A&E Attendances and Emergency Admissions, June 2026.\
The dataset contains 193 records, including one national summary row and 192 organisation-level records across seven NHS England regions.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Data Quality Checks\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The analysis includes checks for missing values, negative attendance counts, invalid waiting-time counts and organisation-code completeness.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

